361
00:41:48,390 --> 00:41:51,330
Make a plan and write a report.

362
00:41:51,330 --> 00:41:54,130
Okay. I understand.

363
00:42:02,390 --> 00:42:06,700
Oppa, you don't need your hands, because I'll be your hands.

364
00:42:06,700 --> 00:42:08,830
- What are you doing?
- Open up!

365
00:42:19,000 --> 00:42:21,940
You can't drink alcohol.

366
00:42:30,990 --> 00:42:33,810
Hyo Seon, don't drink.

367
00:42:33,810 --> 00:42:35,070
Why not?

368
00:42:35,070 --> 00:42:36,950
You drive.

369
00:43:24,650 --> 00:43:26,790
She's horrible...

370
00:43:29,150 --> 00:43:32,110
I'm going crazy...

371
00:43:45,390 --> 00:43:48,120
- Newbie!
- Yes, sir!

372
00:44:18,150 --> 00:44:21,540
I feel like I've seen you around before.

373
00:44:21,540 --> 00:44:23,690
What's your name?

374
00:44:23,690 --> 00:44:26,700
My name is Han Jeong Woo.

375
00:44:28,120 --> 00:44:31,610
You sound like a soldier. Are you?

376
00:44:31,610 --> 00:44:33,980
It hasn't been long since I've returned.

377
00:44:37,590 --> 00:44:40,830
And... I'm not just an ordinary soldier.

378
00:44:40,830 --> 00:44:42,810
I was in the marines.

379
00:44:46,220 --> 00:44:48,020
I see...

380
00:45:37,800 --> 00:45:42,710
♫ In the solictude which wakes me up  ♫

381
00:45:45,170 --> 00:45:48,920
♫ when I wake up from an exhausted sleep ♫

382
00:45:48,920 --> 00:45:50,700
Unni!

383
00:45:50,700 --> 00:45:52,450
Unni!

384
00:45:52,450 --> 00:45:57,830
♫ because I still remember you smiling ♫

385
00:45:57,830 --> 00:45:59,060
Unni!

386
00:45:59,060 --> 00:46:04,420
♫ I'm secretly smiling ♫

