00:48:02,530 --> 00:48:09,930
♫ I can't bear it, so I can't laugh ♫

408
00:48:09,930 --> 00:48:17,800
♫ I'll call out your name again ♫

409
00:48:30,980 --> 00:48:35,190
Noona... What's so hard?

410
00:48:58,850 --> 00:49:02,310
The airdrops that help me breathe.

411
00:49:10,890 --> 00:49:13,890
Nature's grain wine

412
00:49:15,590 --> 00:49:17,420
100% domestic, organically fermented

413
00:49:17,420 --> 00:49:21,350
Daeseong Company Rice Wine

414
00:49:25,730 --> 00:49:29,340
♫ In a small place in my heart ♫

415
00:49:29,340 --> 00:49:34,620
♫ When longing comes again ♫

416
00:49:35,650 --> 00:49:41,040
♫ In the thought of you again, unknowingly again ♫

417
00:49:41,040 --> 00:49:45,360
♫ the tears soon will flow ♫

418
00:49:47,120 --> 00:49:50,720
♫ More than saying you loved me ♫

419
00:49:50,720 --> 00:49:56,670
♫ while you silently look at me  ♫

420
00:49:56,670 --> 00:50:02,400
♫ I said I liked you so much and loved you ♫

421
00:50:02,400 --> 00:50:06,770
♫ Today you must tell me ♫

422
00:50:06,770 --> 00:50:12,730
♫ My love, will you run to me? ♫

423
