♫ I am going to love you this way ♫

434
00:51:10,720 --> 00:51:12,030
♫ My love, will you run to me? ♫

435
00:51:12,030 --> 00:51:13,320
Are there any more?

436
00:51:13,320 --> 00:51:14,420
Where?

437
00:51:14,420 --> 00:51:16,090
Yes.

438
00:51:16,090 --> 00:51:17,370
Yes. I got it.

439
00:51:17,370 --> 00:51:20,370
Where in Jeju Island?

440
00:51:20,370 --> 00:51:22,060
Yes, I understand.

441
00:51:22,060 --> 00:51:23,990
Yes.

442
00:51:23,990 --> 00:51:26,920
How... how did this happen?

443
00:51:26,920 --> 00:51:28,870
Is this what a TV advertisement does?

444
00:51:28,870 --> 00:51:31,370
We have to wait to know if it's just temporary or will be constant.

445
00:51:31,370 --> 00:51:34,110
We can't take any more orders. Turn them down.

446
00:51:34,110 --> 00:51:35,940
Yes, sir.

447
00:51:35,940 --> 00:51:37,700
Turn them all down?

448
00:51:37,700 --> 00:51:42,480
We have to. Even with the orders we have right now, all our machines are being fully operated.

449
00:51:42,480 --> 00:51:44,390
How can we make more?

450
00:51:44,390 --> 00:51:48,360
I understand. Thank you.

451
00:51:49,560 --> 00:51:51,700
We can take more orders.

452
00:51:51,700 --> 00:51:55,990
We're getting support from the Ministry of Agriculture, Food and Rural Affairs.

453
00:51:55,990 --> 00:51:58,790
They sent an auditor remember?

454
00:51:58,790 --> 00:52:00,670
We got it.

455
00:52:00,670 --> 00:52:04,120
With that, we can expand our lines.

456
00:52:09,420 --> 00:52:12,500
Hyo Seon, go get some cotton from the pharmacy!

457
00:52:12,500 --> 00:52:14,660
Okay.

458
00:52:14,660 --> 00:52:17,490
I knew this would happen, okay? I knew it.

459
00:52:17,500 --> 00:52:21,360
How could a person like you be so careless.

460
00:52:21,360 --> 00:52:23,000
I'm fine, I'll hold it.

461
00:52:23,000 --> 00:52:24,560
Stay still.

462
00:52:24,560 --> 00:52:26,920
Hyo Seon! Hurry!

463
00:52:34,690 --> 00:52:36,760
Eun Jo!

464
00:53:10,490 --> 00:53:14,200
Song Eun Jo...

465
00:53:14,200 --> 00:53:17,780
No, Goo Eun Jo...

466
00:53:17,780 --> 00:53:22,400
I can't copy her.

467
00:53:22,400 --> 00:53:25,210
I can't become like her.

468
00:53:26,270 --> 00:53:31,310
If I try to become her, I will split rght in half.

469
00:53:32,060 --> 00:53:36,380
As soon as I realized I can't catch up with her,

470
00:53:39,250 --> 00:53:41,690
I wanted to cry.

471
00:53:42,900 --> 00:53:46,580
It's not because she makes me uneasy,

472
00:53:47,830 --> 00:53:50,830
but my tears wouldn't stop.

473
00:53:52,990 --> 00:53:58,170
I swear to the heaven and the earth,

474
00:53:58,170 --> 00:54:03,560
that everything I said to her was 100% a lie.

475
00:54:05,920 --> 00:54:08,020
Unni...

476
00:54:09,430 --> 00:54:11,570
Unni.

477
00:54:12,880 --> 00:54:15,300
Don't die.

478
00:54:16,920 --> 00:54:19,160
Don't die, Unni.

479
00:54:19,160 --> 00:54:21,400
Just die...

480
00:54:22,320 --> 00:54:24,650
That was an accident.

481
00:54:24,650 --> 00:54:29,740
Unni, I'll be better.

482
00:54:30,990 --> 00:54:34,360
I'll be kinder to you.

483
00:54:34,360 --> 00:54:36,510
Don't die, Unni.

484
00:54:36,510 --> 00:54:39,940
You got a bloody nose because you were picking it, right?

485
00:54:39,940 --> 00:54:45,970
Asking her this was my sincerity.

486
00:54:45,970 --> 00:54:48,060
Unni,

487
00:54:58,320 --> 00:54:59,790
Shut up.

488
00:54:59,790 --> 00:55:01,960
Unni.

489
00:55:03,820 --> 00:55:06,380
I said shut up.

490
00:55:06,380 --> 00:55:08,590
Unni...

491
00:55:08,590 --> 00:55:10,760
Unni...

492
00:55:22,330 --> 00:55:24,430
What are you making a fuss?

493
00:55:24,430 --> 00:55:28,290
Am I dying? Did they say I'm dying?

494
00:55:28,290 --> 00:55:32,590
Or did you wish I would die?

495
00:55:48,540 --> 00:55:50,580
Let go.

496
00:55:51,990 --> 00:55:54,670
What are you doing?

497
00:55:54,670 --> 00:56:00,110
You're the most wicked of them all.

498
00:56:00,110 --> 00:56:04,530
I've never seen someone as wicked as you my entire life.

499
00:56:04,530 --> 00:56:07,850
You want to make me worthless, don't you?

500
00:56:07,850 --> 00:56:11,190
That's why you showed up at our house, right?

501
00:56:12,090 --> 00:56:15,440
Where are you going? Don't you dare move!

502
00:56:15,440 --> 00:56:18,760
I can't stand to watch you move.

503
00:56:18,760 --> 00:56:20,960
I can't bear listening to you speak!

504
00:56:20,960 --> 00:56:25,260
Spending endless nights in the labs to kiss up to Dad,

505
00:56:25,260 --> 00:56:27,300
and getting a bloody nose.

506
00:56:27,300 --> 00:56:30,200
Even if you don't do that, I get compared to you every day

507
00:56:30,200 --> 00:56:33,550
and become more and more useless.

508
00:56:33,550 --> 00:56:36,820
Then you, next to someone as useless as me,

509
00:56:36,820 --> 00:56:40,770
only seem more impressive and diligent.

510
00:56:40,770 --> 00:56:43,280
Try moving one more time.

511
00:56:43,280 --> 00:56:46,080
Try fainting one more time!

512
00:56:47,630 --> 00:56:51,300
I wish someone like you would just die!

513
00:56:51,300 --> 00:56:53,700
What are you saying?

514
00:57:17,600 --> 00:57:19,960
This little punk...

515
00:57:32,940 --> 00:57:34,250
Hyo Seon.

516
00:57:34,250 --> 00:57:35,990
Hyo Seon, stop right there!

517
00:57:35,990 --> 00:57:39,350
Talk to me. Hyo Seon!

518
00:57:46,450 --> 00:57:47,460
What's wrong?

519
00:57:47,460 --> 00:57:50,580
Oppa... Hurry...

520
00:57:50,580 --> 00:57:52,630
Take me.

521
00:57:52,630 --> 00:57:53,980
What?

522
00:57:53,980 --> 00:57:56,190
Hurry up!

523
00:58:17,360 --> 00:58:22,370
They say you're fine. Just take some supplements and rest for a few days.

524
00:58:24,160 --> 00:58:29,750
You're quite blessed. When even you're sick, you get to be sick so extravagantly.

525
00:58:31,130 --> 00:58:34,770
Why are you working so hard?

526
00:58:34,770 --> 00:58:37,890
It'll all become yours even if you don't work so hard, you little bitch.

527
00:58:39,120 --> 00:58:42,270
What? Why?

528
00:58:43,970 --> 00:58:50,940
In the past, when we used to live with that man when we were in Geunsan the time you made the noose...

529
00:58:50,940 --> 00:58:53,790
Did you do that because you really wanted to die?

530
00:58:53,790 --> 00:58:57,620
Are you crazy? Why would I die? It'd be too unfair if I died.

531
00:58:57,620 --> 00:59:00,180
That guy in Geunsan, he would keep chasing after women.

532
00:59:00,180 --> 00:59:05,960
But you really hung yourself. You could've died.

533
00:59:06,660 --> 00:59:10,600
Do you think life comes to you as you want it?

534
00:59:10,600 --> 00:59:12,360
Even if something bad happens,

535
00:59:12,360 --> 00:59:16,410
you have to take risks to gain what you want.

536
00:59:16,410 --> 00:59:19,360
You've still got a long way to go.

537
00:59:20,210 --> 00:59:23,700
If I say I want to leave one more time,

538
00:59:23,700 --> 00:59:26,190
you said you would show me things I shouldn't see, right?

539
00:59:26,190 --> 00:59:28,500
I did.

540
00:59:28,500 --> 00:59:32,740
Does that mean you can make another noose again?

541
00:59:32,740 --> 00:59:34,670
Of course.

542
00:59:36,590 --> 00:59:39,250
Is that all because of me?

543
00:59:40,960 --> 00:59:43,910
Is that for me?

544
00:59:43,910 --> 00:59:45,940
Does it seem like a lie?

545
00:59:46,980 --> 00:59:50,990
I wish it were a lie.

546
01:00:18,020 --> 01:00:22,570
I used to dig around trash bins with you on my back.

547
01:00:22,570 --> 01:00:27,660
Even if it was dirty, I thought it would be better than not feeding you anything.

548
01:00:27,660 --> 01:00:30,820
When you got sick from me feeding you things I dug up,

549
01:00:30,820 --> 01:00:35,730
when you had a fever all night and your eyes flipped upwards

550
01:00:35,730 --> 01:00:38,840
so far that I could only see white,

551
01:00:38,840 --> 01:00:43,530
I prayed to Jesus, Buddha, and the deities

552
01:00:43,530 --> 01:00:45,580
and told them to dare kill my baby.

553
01:00:45,580 --> 01:00:49,030
I told them I wouldn't stay still.

554
01:00:49,030 --> 01:00:54,430
The heavens and all, I would chew it up and swallow it whole.

555
01:00:57,800 --> 01:01:03,460
I gave up on living with dignity on that night.

556
01:01:05,950 --> 01:01:08,250
Do you know who I am?

557
01:01:09,970 --> 01:01:16,570
I fought against Jesus and Buddha and won. To save you.

558
01:01:16,570 --> 01:01:18,620
A noose?

559
01:01:20,670 --> 01:01:23,610
I can make 100 nooses, you bitch.

560
01:01:33,100 --> 01:01:35,430
There's no reason to be touched.

561
01:01:35,430 --> 01:01:38,170
What mother in this world wouldn't do that?

562
01:01:42,650 --> 01:01:47,550
Do you even like Hyo Seon's father?

563
01:01:57,550 --> 01:02:04,170
Is Hyo Seon's father just someone you can take a lot from?

564
01:02:05,890 --> 01:02:07,700
Oh?

565
01:02:07,700 --> 01:02:11,310
You at least like Hyo Seon's father, right?

566
01:02:11,310 --> 01:02:13,790
Why are you asking me something like that?

567
01:02:13,790 --> 01:02:16,990
Tell me that you at least like him a little bit.

568
01:02:16,990 --> 01:02:19,900
If you tell me that he's not just someone you can take a lot from,

569
01:02:19,900 --> 01:02:25,930
but someone you like, then I'll forgive you.

570
01:02:25,930 --> 01:02:28,350
Why are you making such a fuss?

571
01:02:28,350 --> 01:02:30,860
I do like him, why? I like him!

572
01:02:30,960 --> 01:02:33,960
I like him because he has a lot of things I can take from him! Why?

573
01:02:44,790 --> 01:02:52,130
♫ It must be you. I cannot be without you. ♫

574
01:02:52,130 --> 01:02:58,160
♫ Like this for another day, month or year ♫

575
01:02:58,900 --> 01:03:06,390
♫ I don't mind even if I am hurt. ♫

576
01:03:06,390 --> 01:03:12,550
♫ Yes, if it's just you, it is enough ♫

577
01:03:14,520 --> 01:03:22,580
♫ because you are the only one I love. ♫
